sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    loop Steps 1 - 5 repeated for each hash algorithm (SHA256, SHA384, SHA512)
        Note over CS,CSMS: Step 1: CertificateInstalled with certificateType CSMSRootCertificate

        Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a DeleteCertificateRequest

        CSMS->>CS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest
        Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateType contains CSMSRootCertificate OR is omitted

        CS-->>CSMS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsResponse (status = Accepted,<br>certificateHashDataChain[0].certificateType = CSMSRootCertificate,<br>certificateHashDataChain[0].certificateHashData.hashAlgorithm = SHA256)
        Note right of CS: hashAlgorithm is SHA256 as listed in the header,<br>SHA384 / SHA512 in the repeated iterations

        CSMS->>CS: DeleteCertificateRequest (certificateHashData)
        Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateHashData is the<br>certificateHashData returned at Step 3

        CS-->>CSMS: DeleteCertificateResponse (status = Accepted)
    end
